  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook potato in boiling water, over high heat, until easily pierced with a knife, 10-15 mins.\n• Drain and return to saucepan. Add milk, butter and a generous pinch of salt and mash until smooth. Cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64938cef2a47cf9ab0a1c979-4594e8f1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a shallow bowl combine plain flour, roast seasoning, the salt and a good pinch of pepper. In a second shallow bowl, whisk egg. In a third shallow bowl, place panko breadcrumbs.\n• Dip haloumi into flour mixture, followed by egg, and finally in breadcrumbs. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64938cef2a47cf9ab0a1c979-f6a2594c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat and add enough olive oil to coat the base. When oil is hot, cook haloumi until cooked through, 2 mins each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64938cef2a47cf9ab0a1c979-b790807c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate carrot. Transfer to medium bowl and add shredded cabbage mix.\n• Add 1/2 the mayo and a drizzle of vinegar. Toss to coat and season.\n• Divide haloumi, mash and slaw between plates.\n• Serve with remaining mayo.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64938cef2a47cf9ab0a1c979-fcb54808.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
